# TASK-0079 end-to-end run outputs (__WORK_IN_PROGRESS__/scripts/run_challenge.py):
# regeneratable per-target connectivity matrix / hit list / report / verdict,
# up to several MB each (dense N x N .npz). Numbers are already transcribed
# into the git-tracked __WORK_IN_PROGRESS__/RESULTS.md narrative. Revisit once
# TASK-0083 (the real result-artifact contract) decides the permanent
# storage/versioning strategy -- this is the interim decision, not that one.
# (Fixed 2026-08-21: this pattern was `__WORK_IN_PROGRESS__/RESULTS/` --
# wrong case, wrong path -- and never matched the real, lowercase
# __WORK_IN_PROGRESS__/results/ directory this comment describes; nothing
# under it was ever actually ignored. Files already tracked before this fix
# stay tracked -- gitignore does not retroactively untrack anything. This
# pattern also now covers results/tasks/<task>/ -- the ~50 `results_task*/`
# directories that used to sit loose at the WIP root, consolidated into one
# per-task-per-folder location under here, same regeneratable rationale.)
__WORK_IN_PROGRESS__/results/

